SUMMARY:Living Lightly in Datk Times: The Art of Transforming Adversity
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nLivin
 g Lightly in Dark Times: The Art of Transforming Adversity with Modern Bud
 dhism Teacher Hannah Kim\n\n**Saturday 8/8 10:30am-1:00 pm**\nIt is said i
 n Buddha’s sutras\, that in degenerate times practitioners of a particul
 ar secret dharma\, called Lojong\, or training the mind\, will be able to 
 transform even the most difficult appearances into the spiritual path. Thi
 s special set of teachings once held for centuries by dharma masters in se
 cret and passed to disciples only after years of training\, are simple to 
 apply practically in the trenches of daily life\, and they are powerful me
 thods for transforming adversity. Course will include guided meditation\, 
 talks\, and Q&A. Everyone Welcome.\nCost: $30 (Discounts and online option
 s for members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditationinasheville
 .org/living-lightly-in-dark-times-the-art-of-transforming-adversity-half-d
 ay-course/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/becom
 e-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31586494
 0/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260727T210711Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260727T210711Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_315761265@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260808T022216Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260809T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260809T114500
SUMMARY:Dealing with Difficult Emotions
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nDeali
 ng with Difficult Emotions with Modern Buddhism Teacher Jill Cagney\n\n**S
 undays 6/28-8/9 10:30am-11:45am**\nOverwhelmed by your feelings? Buddhist 
 psychology offers a time-tested\, powerful and healthy approach to dealing
  with painful\, challenging emotions. Each week\, we will apply these meth
 ods to states like craving\, anger\, jealousy\, and self-hatred. First\, w
 e need to recognize them\, learn how they work\, and accept ourselves for 
 where we are\, Next\, we can disempower them using special meditations. Fi
 nally\, we can envision and even experience a state of total freedom and r
 elease\, having transcended these difficult emotions.\nCost: $12 (free and
  online options for members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditat
 ioninasheville.org/sunday-drop-in-meditation-class/)\n[Become a Member](ht
 tps://www.meditationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31576126
 5/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260720T145254Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T145254Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_315959528@meetup.com
